<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
<title>Kjarnajöfnur</title>
<metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
  <md:content-id>m68852</md:content-id>
  <md:title>Kjarnajöfnur</md:title>
  <md:abstract><para id="para-00001">Þegar þú hefur lokið við þennan kafla geturðu:</para><list id="list-00001"><item>Þekkt algengar agnir og orku sem koma við sögu í kjarnahvörfum</item><item>Skrifað og stillt kjarnajöfnur</item></list></md:abstract>
  <md:uuid>928aa888-145d-44e7-8249-6c08876d50ff</md:uuid>
</metadata>

<content>
<para id="fs-idp10810528">Changes of nuclei that result in changes in their atomic numbers, mass numbers, or energy states are <term id="term-00001">nuclear reactions</term>. To describe a nuclear reaction, we use an equation that identifies the nuclides involved in the reaction, their mass numbers and atomic numbers, and the other particles involved in the reaction.</para>
<section id="fs-idp49661760">
<title>Tegundir agna í kjarnahvörfum</title>
<para id="fs-idm5999248">Many entities can be involved in nuclear reactions. The most common are protons, neutrons, alpha particles, beta particles, positrons, and gamma rays, as shown in <link target-id="CNX_Chem_21_02_Nuclearrxs"/>. Protons <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>p</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> also represented by the symbol <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:math> and neutrons <m:math><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:math> are the constituents of atomic nuclei, and have been described previously. <term id="term-00002">Alpha particles</term> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> also represented by the symbol <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>α</m:mtext><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:math> are high-energy helium nuclei. <term id="term-00003">Beta particles</term> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mn>−1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msubsup><m:mtext>β</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> also represented by the symbol <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mn>−1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msubsup><m:mtext>e</m:mtext><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> are high-energy electrons, and gamma rays are photons of very high-energy electromagnetic radiation. <term id="term-00004">Positrons</term> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mn>+1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msubsup><m:mtext>e</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> also represented by the symbol <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mn>+1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msubsup><m:mtext>β</m:mtext><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> are positively charged electrons (“anti-electrons”). The subscripts and superscripts are necessary for balancing nuclear equations, but are usually optional in other circumstances. For example, an alpha particle is a helium nucleus (He) with a charge of +2 and a mass number of 4, so it is symbolized <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> This works because, in general, the ion charge is not important in the balancing of nuclear equations.</para>
<figure id="CNX_Chem_21_02_Nuclearrxs"><media id="fs-idp74884384" class="scaled-down" alt="This table has four columns and seven rows. The first row is a header row and it labels each column: “Name,” “Symbol(s),” “Representation,” and “Description.” Under the “Name” column are the following: “Alpha particle,” “Beta particle,” “Positron,” “Proton,” “Neutron,” and “Gamma ray.” Under the “Symbol(s)” column are the following: “ superscript 4 stacked over a subscript 2 H e or lowercase alpha,” “superscript 0 stacked over a subscript 1 e or lowercase beta,” “superscript 0 stacked over a positive subscript 1 e or lowercase beta superscript positive sign,” “superscript 1 stacked over a subscript 1 H or lowercase rho superscript 1 stacked over a subscript 1 H,” “superscript 1 stacked over a subscript 0 n or lowercase eta superscript 1 stacked over a subscript 0 n,” and a lowercase gamma. Under the “Representation column,” are the following: two white sphere attached to two blue spheres of about the same size with positive signs in them; a small red sphere with a negative sign in it; a small red sphere with a positive sign in it; a blue spheres with a positive sign in it; a white sphere; and a purple squiggle ling with an arrow pointing right to a lowercase gamma. Under the “Description” column are the following: “(High-energy) helium nuclei consisting of two protons and two neutrons,” “(High-energy) elections,” “Particles with the same mass as an electron but with 1 unit of positive charge,” “Nuclei of hydrogen atoms,” “Particles with a mass approximately equal to that of a proton but with no charge,” and “Very high-energy electromagnetic radiation.”">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_Chem_21_03_RadioDecay-d92b.jpg"/>
</media>

<caption>Þótt margar tegundir komi fyrir í kjarnahvörfum er í þessari töflu tekið saman heiti, tákn, framsetning og lýsing á þeim algengustu.</caption></figure>
<para id="fs-idp183438528">Note that positrons are exactly like electrons, except they have the opposite charge. They are the most common example of <term id="term-00005">antimatter</term>, particles with the same mass but the opposite state of another property (for example, charge) than ordinary matter. When antimatter encounters ordinary matter, both are annihilated and their mass is converted into energy in the form of <term id="term-00006">gamma rays (γ)</term>—and other much smaller subnuclear particles, which are beyond the scope of this chapter—according to the mass-energy equivalence equation <emphasis effect="italics">E</emphasis> = <emphasis effect="italics">mc</emphasis><sup>2</sup>, seen in the preceding section. For example, when a positron and an electron collide, both are annihilated and two gamma ray photons are created:</para>
<equation id="fs-idm4841104" class="unnumbered"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mn>−1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msubsup><m:mtext>e</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mn>+1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msubsup><m:mtext>e</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>γ</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mtext>γ</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-idp95362336">Eins og sést í kaflanum um ljós og rafsegulgeislun samanstanda gammageislar af stuttbylgju, orkuríkri rafsegulgeislun og eru (mun) orkumeiri en betur þekktir röntgengeislar sem geta hagað sér eins og agnir í tvíeðli bylgju og agnar. Gammageislar eru tegund af orkuríkri rafsegulgeislun sem myndast þegar kjarni fer úr hærra í lægra orkuástand, svipað og ljóseind myndast við rafeindaskipti úr hærra í lægra orkustig. Vegna mun meiri orkumunar milli kjarnaorkusvigrúma hafa gammageislar sem koma frá kjarna orku sem er venjulega milljón sinnum meiri en rafsegulgeislun sem kemur frá rafeindaskiptum.</para>
</section>
<section id="fs-idp244461456">
<title>Stilling kjarnahvarfa</title>
<para id="fs-idp1433408">A balanced chemical reaction equation reflects the fact that during a chemical reaction, bonds break and form, and atoms are rearranged, but the total numbers of atoms of each element are conserved and do not change. A balanced nuclear reaction equation indicates that there is a rearrangement during a nuclear reaction, but of nucleons (subatomic particles within the atoms’ nuclei) rather than atoms. Nuclear reactions also follow conservation laws, and they are balanced in two ways:</para>
<list id="fs-idp258853168" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic">
<item>The sum of the mass numbers of the reactants equals the sum of the mass numbers of the products.</item>
<item>Summa hleðslna hvarfefnanna er jöfn summu hleðslna myndefnanna.</item>
</list>
<para id="fs-idp75480592">Ef sætistala og massatala allra agna í kjarnahvarfi nema einnar eru þekktar getum við borið kennsl á ögnina með því að stilla hvarfið. Til dæmis gætum við ákvarðað að <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext></m:math> sé afurð kjarnahvarfs <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>N</m:mtext></m:math> og <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext></m:math> ef við vissum að róteind, <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>, væri önnur af tveimur afurðum. <link target-id="fs-idp244468800"/> sýnir hvernig við getum borið kennsl á kjarnategund með því að stilla kjarnahvarfið.</para>
<example id="fs-idp244468800">
<para id="fs-idm88392256"><title>Að stilla jöfnur fyrir kjarnahvörf</title>Hvarf α-agnar við magnesíum-25 <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Mg</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> myndar róteind og kjarnategund annars frumefnis. Berið kennsl á nýju kjarnategundina sem myndast.</para><para id="fs-idp18427424"><title>Lausn</title>Kjarnahvarfið má skrifa sem:</para>
<equation id="fs-idp203120768" class="unnumbered"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Mg</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mtext>Z</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>A</m:mtext></m:msubsup><m:mtext>X</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation><para id="fs-idp25412848">þar sem A er massatala og Z er sætistala nýju kjarnategundarinnar, X. Þar sem summa massatala hvarfefnanna verður að vera jöfn summu massatala afurðanna:</para>
<equation id="fs-idp153027632" class="unnumbered"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mtext>A</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>or A</m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>28</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-idp17439568">Á sama hátt verða hleðslurnar að vera jafnar, svo:</para>
<equation id="fs-idp11232080" class="unnumbered"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mtext>Z</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>and Z</m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-idp127002784">Athugið lotukerfið: Frumefnið með kjarnhleðslu = +13 er ál. Þannig er afurðin <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>28</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Al</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="fs-idp228146336"><title>Kannaðu þekkingu þína</title>Kjarnategundin <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>53</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>125</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>I</m:mtext></m:math> sameinast rafeind og myndar nýjan kjarna og engar aðrar massamiklar agnir. Hver er jafnan fyrir þetta hvarf?</para><note id="fs-idp155967328">
<title>Svar:</title>
<para id="fs-idp147027376"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>53</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>125</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>I</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mn>−1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msubsup><m:mtext>e</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>52</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>125</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Te</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para></note>
</example>
<para id="fs-idm5877152">Eftirfarandi eru jöfnur nokkurra kjarnahvarfa sem gegna mikilvægu hlutverki í sögu kjarnaefnafræðinnar:</para>
<list id="fs-idp95347744" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Fyrsta náttúrulega óstöðuga frumefnið sem var einangrað, póloníum, var uppgötvað af pólska vísindamanninum Marie <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00007">Curie</term> og eiginmanni hennar Pierre árið 1898. Það sundrast og gefur frá sér α-agnir:<newline/> <equation id="fs-idp31649008" class="unnumbered"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>84</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>212</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Po</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>82</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>208</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Pb</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation></item>
<item>Fyrsta kjarnategundin sem var framleidd með tilbúnum hætti var samsæta súrefnis, <sup>17</sup>O. Hún var búin til af Ernest <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00008">Rutherford</term> árið 1919 með því að skjóta α-ögnum á köfnunarefnisatóm:<newline/> <equation id="fs-idp1428976" class="unnumbered"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>N</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation></item>
<item>James <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00009">Chadwick</term> uppgötvaði nifteindina árið 1932, sem áður óþekkta hlutlausa ögn sem myndaðist ásamt <sup>12</sup>C við kjarnahvarf milli <sup>9</sup>Be og <sup>4</sup>He:<newline/> <equation id="fs-idp93036048" class="unnumbered"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Be</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation></item>
<item>Fyrsta frumefnið sem var framleitt og kemur ekki fyrir náttúrulega á jörðinni, teknetíum, var búið til með því að skjóta tvívetnum (þungu vetni, <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:math>) á mólýbden af Emilio <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00010">Segre</term> og Carlo <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00011">Perrier</term> árið 1937:<newline/> <equation id="fs-idp34445296" class="unnumbered"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>97</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Mo</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>43</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>97</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Tc</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation></item>
<item>Fyrsta stýrða kjarnakeðjuhvarfið var framkvæmt í kjarnaofni við Chicago-háskóla árið 1942. Eitt af mörgum hvörfum sem áttu sér stað var:<newline/> <equation id="fs-idp77197616" class="unnumbered"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>92</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>235</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>U</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>87</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Br</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>57</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>146</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>La</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation></item>
</list>
</section>
<section id="fs-idp161138832" class="summary">
<title>Lykilhugtök og samantekt</title>
<para id="fs-idp3176832">Kjarnar geta tekið þátt í hvörfum sem breyta fjölda róteinda þeirra, fjölda nifteinda eða orkuástandi. Margar mismunandi agnir geta tekið þátt í kjarnahvörfum. Algengastar eru róteindir, nifteindir, jáeindir (sem eru jákvætt hlaðnar rafeindir), alfaagnir (α) (sem eru orkumiklir helíumkjarnar), betaagnir (β) (sem eru orkumiklar rafeindir) og gammageislar (γ) (sem samanstanda af orkumikilli rafsegulgeislun). Eins og með efnahvörf eru kjarnahvörf alltaf stillt. Þegar kjarnahvarf á sér stað haldast heildarmassi (fjöldi) og heildarhleðsla óbreytt.</para>
</section>
<section id="fs-idp77230864" class="exercises">
<title>Efnafræði – verkefni í lok kafla</title>
<exercise id="fs-idp161987712">
<problem id="fs-idp35676256">
<para id="fs-idp1411168">Skrifaðu stutta lýsingu eða skilgreiningu á hverju eftirfarandi:</para>
<para id="fs-idp82665216">(a) kjarnaeind</para>
<para id="fs-idp101713008">(b) α-ögn</para>
<para id="fs-idp15833856">(c) β-ögn</para>
<para id="fs-idm47984912">(d) jáeind</para>
<para id="fs-idp7335552">(e) γ-geisli</para>
<para id="fs-idp710880">(f) kjarnategund</para>
<para id="fs-idp51919152">(g) massatala</para>
<para id="fs-idp79754624">(h) sætistala</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idp82822912">
<para id="fs-idp227711248">(a) Kjarnaeind er sérhver ögn sem er í kjarna atómsins, þannig að það getur átt við róteindir og nifteindir. (b) α-ögn er ein afurð náttúrulegrar geislavirkni og er kjarni helíumatóms. (c) β-ögn er afurð náttúrulegrar geislavirkni og er háhraða rafeind. (d) Jáeind er ögn með sama massa og rafeind en með jákvæða hleðslu. (e) Gammageislar samanstanda af orkumikilli rafsegulgeislun með stutta bylgjulengd. (f) Kjarnategund er hugtak sem notað er þegar vísað er til einnar tegundar kjarna. (g) Massatala er summa fjölda róteinda og fjölda nifteinda í frumefni. (h) Sætistala er fjöldi róteinda í kjarna frumefnis.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp158311008">
<problem id="fs-idp40874800">
<para id="fs-idm19004416">Hverjar af hinum ýmsu ögnum (α-ögnum, β-ögnum og svo framvegis) sem geta myndast í kjarnahvarfi eru í raun kjarnar?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp126933936">
<problem id="fs-idp202790224">
<para id="fs-idp50138432">Ljúktu við eftirfarandi jöfnur með því að bæta við þeim efnum sem vantar:</para>
<para id="fs-idp28498560">(a) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Al</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>?</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="fs-idp201885664">(b) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.4em"/><m:mn>94</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>239</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Pu</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo>?</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>96</m:mn></m:mrow>
<m:mn>242</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Cm</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="fs-idm8983536">(c) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>N</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>?</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="fs-idp147396032">(d) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>92</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>235</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>U</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>?</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>55</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>135</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Cs</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-idp76491664">
<para id="fs-idp32182000">(a) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Al</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>30</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>P</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> (b) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.4em"/><m:mn>94</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>239</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Pu</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>96</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>242</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Cm</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> (c) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>N</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> (d) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>92</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>235</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>U</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>37</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>96</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Rb</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>55</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>135</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Cs</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm5988192">
<problem id="fs-idp147645296">
<para id="fs-idp74159184">Ljúktu við eftirfarandi jöfnur:</para>
<para id="fs-idp237040000">(a) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Li</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mtext>?</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="fs-idp105650304">(b) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>N</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mtext>?</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="fs-idp159474384">(c) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Al</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>?</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="fs-idp62900608">(d) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>96</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>250</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Cm</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>?</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>38</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>98</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Sr</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp225643904">
<problem id="fs-idp4814048">
<para id="fs-idp166353408">Skrifaðu stillta jöfnu fyrir hvert eftirfarandi kjarnahvarf:</para>
<para id="fs-idp160023024">(a) myndun <sup>17</sup>O úr <sup>14</sup>N með árekstri við α-eind</para>
<para id="fs-idp167819312">(b) myndun <sup>14</sup>C úr <sup>14</sup>N með árekstri við nifteind</para>
<para id="fs-idp163053056">(c) myndun <sup>233</sup>Th úr <sup>232</sup>Th með árekstri við nifteind</para>
<para id="fs-idp25746336">(d) myndun <sup>239</sup>U úr <sup>238</sup>U með árekstri við <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext></m:math></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-idp40755120">
<para id="fs-idp233165328">(a) <m:math><m:mrow>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>N</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>He</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> (b) <m:math><m:mrow>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> (c) <m:math><m:mrow>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>90</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>232</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Th</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>n</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>90</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>233</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>Th</m:mtext><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> (d) <m:math><m:mrow>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mphantom><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mphantom><m:mn>92</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>238</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>U</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>92</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>239</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>U</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo>
<m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp59747856">
<problem id="fs-idp39294832">
<para id="fs-idp250174032">Teknetín-99 er búið til úr <sup>98</sup>Mo. Mólýbden-98 sameinast nifteind og myndar mólýbden-99, óstöðuga samsætu sem gefur frá sér β-eind og myndar örvað form af teknetíni-99, táknað sem <sup>99</sup>Tc<sup>*</sup>. Þessi örvaði kjarni slakar á niður í grunnástand, táknað sem <sup>99</sup>Tc, með því að gefa frá sér γ-geisla. Grunnástand <sup>99</sup>Tc gefur síðan frá sér β-eind. Skrifaðu jöfnurnar fyrir hvert þessara kjarnahvarfa.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp74968928">
<problem id="fs-idp243573632">
<para id="fs-idp201595904">Massi atómsins <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/></m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>F</m:mtext></m:math> er 18,99840 amu.</para><para id="fs-idp41347120">(a) Reiknaðu bindinorku þess á atóm í milljónum rafeindarvolta.</para>
<para id="fs-idp37663696">(b) Reiknaðu bindinorku þess á kjarnaeind.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idp243952112">
<para id="fs-idm13635072">(a) 148,8 MeV á atóm; (b) 7,808 MeV/kjarnaeind</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp208355344">
<problem id="fs-idp17681328">
<para id="fs-idp91057312">Fyrir hvarfið <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext>N</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mtext>?</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>, ef 100,0 g af kolefni hvarfast, hvert er rúmmál köfnunarefnisgass (N<sub>2</sub>) sem myndast við 273 K og 1 atm?</para></problem>
</exercise>
</section>
</content>
<glossary>
<definition id="fs-idm57603984">
<term>alfaeind (e. alpha particle)</term>
<meaning id="fs-idm57603984-meaning"><emphasis effect="bold">(Α</emphasis> eða <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn mathvariant="bold">2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn mathvariant="bold">4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">He</m:mtext></m:math> eða <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn mathvariant="bold">2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn mathvariant="bold">4</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">α</m:mtext><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:math> orkuríkur helínkjarni; helínatóm sem hefur misst tvær rafeindir og inniheldur tvær róteindir og tvær nifteindir</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-idm54113552">
<term>andefni (e. antimatter)</term>
<meaning id="fs-idm54113552-meaning">eindir með sama massa en gagnstæða eiginleika (svo sem hleðslu) og venjulegar eindir</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-idp335278976">
<term>betaeind (e. beta particle)</term>
<meaning id="fs-idp335278976-meaning"><m:math><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">(β</m:mtext></m:math> eða <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mn mathvariant="bold">−1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn mathvariant="bold">0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msubsup><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">e</m:mtext></m:math> eða <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mn mathvariant="bold">−1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn mathvariant="bold">0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msubsup><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">β</m:mtext><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">)</m:mtext></m:math> orkurík rafeind</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-idm12021616">
<term>gammageisli (e. gamma ray)</term>
<meaning id="fs-idm12021616-meaning"><emphasis effect="bold">(Γ</emphasis> eða <m:math><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn mathvariant="bold">0</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn mathvariant="bold">0</m:mn></m:msubsup><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">γ</m:mtext><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">)</m:mtext></m:math> stuttbylgju, orkurík rafsegulgeislun sem sýnir tvíeðli bylgju og eindar</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-idm45950256">
<term>kjarnahvarf (e. nuclear reaction)</term>
<meaning id="fs-idm45950256-meaning">breyting á kjarna sem leiðir til breytinga á sætistölu, massatölu eða orkuástandi</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-idp72108384">
<term>jákvæðiseind <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>(</m:mtext><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mn>+1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msubsup><m:mtext>β</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> eða <m:math><m:mrow><m:msubsup><m:mrow/><m:mn>+1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msubsup><m:mtext>e</m:mtext><m:mtext>)</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> (e. positron (+10β or +10e))</term>
<meaning id="fs-idp72108384-meaning">andeind rafeindarinnar; hún hefur sömu eiginleika og rafeind, fyrir utan að hafa gagnstæða (jákvæða) hleðslu</meaning>
</definition>
</glossary>
